B2  d-|d D G|B2 A|A2 G|AA  A |A G A|B2 A|A G2||
B2  d-|d D G|B2 A|A2 G|A2  A-|A G A|B2 A|A G2 |
Bd  D-|D B2-|B2 A|A2 G|A A A |A G A|B2 A|A2 G|]

